{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0062_1000_008tak", "source_sha256": "355984723f4f2342096fb0291cbdc748dc2727968870ccf711c347550301192d", "ja": "{$P$}、この度の魔女っ娘ドラマでの\n私の演技、いかがでしたか？", "zh": "{$P$}，在这次小魔女电视剧中，\n你觉得小女子的演技如何呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0062_1001_p", "source_sha256": "dda9159631a8b3019eff9c0e3590b4935e7969389ae886878eb167f87d5c754d", "ja": "ああ、よかったぞ！\n貴音の新しい一面を見せてもらった、って感じだな。", "zh": "嗯，很棒喔！\n感觉见识到贵音新的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0062_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "13d38ef0b810b44dd4143babcd272e5eea833e10abe418c522e411b23c0c7247", "ja": "それは何よりです。私にとっても、\n魔女っ娘というのは新鮮な役柄でした。", "zh": "那就太好了。对小女子来说，\n小魔女也是演起来很新鲜的角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0062_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "5445c10c35f59647274de01a509b8be2d44fdc28e1edbcc726f5915891d7236b", "ja": "闇夜の空に舞い、面妖なる力を自在に操る娘……。\n真、参考になりました。", "zh": "飞舞于黑暗夜空，自由运用甚奇之力的女孩……\n着实有参考价值。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0062_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c25c63d0607d17313b5261f9725089e042a9a8dd57a530e2f4aa85b24afcb9bc", "ja": "へえ、参考になったのか……。", "zh": "哦～有参考价值啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0062_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "ccc51d0b2adb2e1410d1760e6a4d909ca382cd25573e2916b82121cd0b1b7858", "ja": "ふふっ、{$P$}？　もしも本当に、\n私に面妖な力があったとしたら、どうなさいますか？", "zh": "呵呵，{$P$}，\n若小女子真有了甚奇的力量，你会怎么做呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0062_1006_p", "source_sha256": "84c56f67a1bfa984d13bf8a2a9922653099517cf48f770d9dbb4fa168a05c002", "ja": "うん？　そりゃまあ驚くだろうけど……。\nでも結局は、どうもしないと思うよ。", "zh": "嗯？那当然会很惊讶吧……\n不过我想到头来，应该还是不会特别做什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0062_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "ca7a8d7748a57442f9c7aa82ca1ab156e4b5f50272f059a09d0cf0fc195d6e26", "ja": "まあ。……あの、気にならない、と？", "zh": "哎呀……请问，你是指不会特别在意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0062_1008_p", "source_sha256": "22304e9b0abf56be4443c9d95ad566d040373e5a19c3e20cdbcfe671002d7613", "ja": "便利でいいとは思うけどな！\n魔女っ娘とアイドルは、相性もいい気がするし。", "zh": "我觉得很方便很好啊！\n而且小魔女跟偶像，感觉也很搭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0062_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "c7ede0ffb1ebe81d0ff4ce90ce401a9926b15bfc951acc91e98dd9d8a6b5551b", "ja": "アイドル……。ふふっ、そうですね！\n確かに、あなた様のおっしゃる通り……。", "zh": "偶像……呵呵，是啊！\n确实，正如官人所说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0062_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "860a379946356c693f67331fc6e8226890d856e8a3eace9e33f5a885d65de7b1", "ja": "どのような力があろうと、為すべき事は変わりません。\nあなた様、これからも……よろしくお願いいたします！", "zh": "不管有了什么样的力量，要做的事都不会变。\n官人，今后……也请多多指教了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
